    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Elephants in the Fog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A parent’s search for their missing child disrupts the fragile coexistence between Nepal’s kinnar community and the rest of a village’s population."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/dreamed-adventure-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "The Dreamed Adventure"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Featuring a vibrant lead performance, this gripping realist drama, set in a lawless town on the Bulgaria-Turkey border, exudes an atmosphere of danger and paranoia."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/my-notes-on-mars-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "My Notes on Mars"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In Lili Horvát’s beguiling third feature, the sudden return of Sam’s missing wife, who has no memory of anything except her scientific research, gives their relationship another chance."
    }
